{"id":"vod_bf_45979","vodId":"45979","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"中二病也要谈恋爱！第一季","name_cn":"中二病也要谈恋爱！第一季","date":"2012-01-01","year":"2012","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.bfzypic.com/upload/vod/20230424-47/327e66f40515da0d7398a4f676f570c4.jpg"},"summary":"顺利升入高中的少年富樫勇太（福山润 配音）在初中时代曾是暗黑系的中二病患者，当年他自称黑炎之主人，自我感觉良好地度过了无厘头的中学生活。但是此刻他“痛改前非”，将这段经历看作不堪回首的耻辱过去，为此甚至不惜报考一个离家很远没有人认识自己的高中。在新的学校，勇太如愿以偿结 交了一色诚（保志总一朗 配音）、丹生谷森夏（赤崎千夏 配音）以及学姐五月七日茴香（浅仓幸美 配音）这样稍显正常的朋友，也准备和心仪的女孩大谈一场浪漫恋爱。但是令他备为挠头的是，楼上新搬来的住户兼同班同学小鸟游六花（内田真礼 配音）却是一个中二病的深度患者。小女孩每天唧唧歪歪，怪力乱神。好不容易摆脱初中阴影的勇太，高中恋爱之梦日渐飘渺……","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-04-02 17:58:47","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/zhongerbingyeyaotanlianai/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241024mWjPGiiqindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/zhongerbingyeyaotanlianai/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/zhongerbingyeyaotanlianai/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241024vwc8YZUcindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241024oITfFkItindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/zhongerbingyeyaotanlianai/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf5.com/video/zhongerbingyeyaotanlianai/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.rrcdnbf6.com/video/zhongerbingyeyaotanlianai/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241024qwvaKfGxindex.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://p.bvvvvvvvvv1f.com/video/replacexxx0810/20241024gtu63pZ9index.m3u8/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"ht